id: QUAL-058
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Catching generic Exception (too broad)
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .java .kt .cs .py
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: catch\s*\(\s*Exception\s
    message: "Catching generic Exception — catches everything including programming errors. Catch specific types."
  - regex: catch\s*\(\s*Throwable\s
    message: "Catching Throwable — includes OutOfMemoryError and other fatal errors. Catch specific types."
  - regex: except\s+Exception\s*:
    message: "Catching generic Exception (Python) — use specific exception types"
fix: Catch specific exception types. catch (IOException e) instead of catch (Exception e).
